    "answer": "and/as-well-as",
    "mnemonic": "To <ja>及ぶ</ja> is \"to reach\" or \"to amount to.\" The noun version is more like a grammar thing, as it means \"<vocabulary>as well as</vocabulary>.\" Perhaps if you are reaching a certain point or certain amount, then you are adding things on. That's why \"as well as\" is the meaning of this one.",
